        "Product Advantages",
        "1. High vibration frequency with low amplitude for high screening penetration rate.\n2. Multi‑stream feeding realizes high screen‑deck utilization and large processing capacity.\n3. Screen frame supported by rubber springs for vibration isolation and sound absorption with low noise.\n4. Low power consumption and high classification & screen‑deck efficiency.",
